{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39739","headline":"寄同年李侍郎龟正 · 黄滔","name":"寄同年李侍郎龟正","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石门南面泪浪浪，自此东西失帝乡。\n崑璞要疑方卓绝，大鹏须息始开张。\n已归天上趋双阙，忽喜人间捧八行。\n莫道秋霜不滋物，菊花还借後时黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}